Package: devjam-science-wallpapers
Version: 1.0-3
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: CLS lab desktop wallpapers for normal and experiment mode
 Desktop wallpapers for the lab computers that show whether the system
 runs in normal mode or in experiment mode, with short instructions on
 where to save research data and how to print system information.
 Available in 1920x1080 and 3840x2160, installed in
 /usr/share/wallpapers/cls.
